  "title": "Persian Shish Kabob",
  "description": "This Persian shish kabob recipe features cubed beef tenderloin marinated overnight in lime juice, chopped onion, salt, and pepper, then skewered and grilled.",
  "authors": [
    "Manouchehr Delshakib"
  ],
